        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="commitment-card">
        <div class="commitment-icon-box">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M11.8 10.9c-2.27-.59-3-1.2-3-2.15 0-1.09 1.01-1.85 2.7-1.85 1.78 0 2.44.85 2.5 2.1h2.21c-.07-1.72-1.12-3.3-3.21-3.81V3h-3v2.16c-1.94.42-3.5 1.68-3.5 3.61 0 2.31 1.91 3.46 4.7 4.13 2.5.6 3 1.48 3 2.41 0 .69-.49 1.79-2.7 1.79-2.06 0-2.87-.92-2.98-2.1h-2.2c.12 2.19 1.76 3.42 3.68 3.83V21h3v-2.15c1.95-.37 3.5-1.5 3.5-3.55 0-2.84-2.43-3.81-4.7-4.4z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Firm Upfront Pricing Guarantee</h3>
          <p>No hidden surprise costs or confusing contractor bids. You receive an itemized written estimate detailing squares, materials, underlayment, and labor before tear-off starts.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="commitment-card">
        <div class="commitment-icon-box">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 1L3 5v6c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9-12V5l-9-4zm-2 16l-4-4 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l6.59-6.59L18 9l-8 8z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Rigorous Safety &amp; Deck Checks</h3>
          <p>Your home's structural safety is non-negotiable. Every roof installation concludes with strict deck fastening checks, magnetic nail sweeps across the entire perimeter, and cleanup.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Building Codes & Additional Info -->
<section style="padding: 3.5rem 0; background: #ffffff;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 900px;">
    <!-- ZIP Codes Served -->
    <h2>ZIP Codes Served in {{ city.name }}</h2>
    <p>
      Our referral network covers all neighborhoods and properties within {{ city.name }}, including the following primary postal ZIP codes:
    </p>
    <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; margin: 1rem 0 2rem 0;">
      {% for z in city.zips %}
      <span style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-primary);">
        {{ z }}
      </span>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <!-- Also Serving Nearby Communities -->
    {% if city.nearbyCities and city.nearbyCities.length > 0 %}
    <h2>Also Serving Nearby Communities</h2>
    <p>We also connect homeowners with licensed roofing professionals in communities neighboring {{ city.name }}:</p>
    <div class="state-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      {% for n in city.nearbyCities %}
      <a href="/{{ n.stateSlug }}/{{ n.slug }}/" class="state-link">
        <span>{{ n.name }}, {{ city.stateAbbr }}</span>
        <span class="state-abbr">&rarr;</span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    <!-- Local FAQs -->
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions in {{ city.name }}</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-summary">How much does a new shingle roof cost in {{ city.name }}?</summary>
        <div class="faq-content">
          <p>For an average 2,000 square foot single-family home in {{ city.name }}, architectural asphalt shingle installation generally costs between $8,600 and $11,800. Final project cost depends on roof slope pitch, number of old shingle layers to tear off, and condition of the underlying roof decking.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-summary">How long does roof replacement take in {{ city.name }}?</summary>
        <div class="faq-content">
          <p>Most residential roof replacements in {{ city.name }} are completed in 1 to 2 days by an experienced 5-6 person crew, weather permitting. Complete cleanup with rolling magnetic sweeps is performed daily.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-summary">Are contractors in {{ city.name }} licensed and insured?</summary>
        <div class="faq-content">
          <p>Yes. All independent roofing contractors in the American Shingle Co. referral network must verify compliance with {{ city.state }} state and {{ city.county }} licensing, bonding, insurance, and municipal permit requirements.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>

    <!-- Final Call to Action (Matching furnacerepairpros.com) -->
    <div style="background: var(--color-primary); color: #ffffff; padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); text-align: center; margin-top: 3rem;">
      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0;">Speak With a Local Roofing Specialist in {{ city.name }}</h2>
      <p style="color: #cbd5e1; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem auto;">
        Speak directly with a licensed roofing specialist serving {{ city.name }}. Average partner contractor response time is {{ site.responseTime }}.
      </p>
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneTel }}" class="btn btn-primary" id="contact-cta-{{ city.slug }}">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M6.62 10.79a15.053 15.053 0 006.59 6.59l2.2-2.2c.27-.27.67-.36 1.02-.24 1.12.37 2.33.57 3.57.57.55 0 1 .45 1 1V20c0 .55-.45 1-1 1-9.39 0-17-7.61-17-17 0-.55.45-1 1-1h3.5c.55 0 1 .45 1 1 0 1.25.2 2.45.57 3.57.11.35.03.74-.25 1.02l-2.2 2.2z"/></svg>
          Call Now: {{ site.phoneDisplay }}
        </a>
        <a href="/states/{{ city.stateSlug }}/" class="btn btn-secondary">
          Browse {{ city.state }} Directory &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
